### Open a ticket
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{"subject":"Unable to reset password","priority":"high"}

### Read tickets
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tickets?limit=10

### Read the first ticket
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tickets/1

### Close it
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/tickets/1/close

### Delete it
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/tickets/1
